---
layout: layouts/showdown.njk
permalink: /compare/
title: City Showdowns — Digital Nomad Comparisons 2026
description: Side-by-side city comparisons for digital nomads. Real 2026 tax rates, verified cost of living data, and visa requirements for every major nomad destination.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>City Showdowns — Digital Nomad Comparisons 2026 | NomadBudgeter</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Side-by-side city comparisons for digital nomads. Real 2026 tax rates, verified cost of living data, and visa requirements for every major nomad destination.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.nomadbudgeter.com/compare/">
  <meta property="og:title" content="City Showdowns — Digital Nomad City Comparisons 2026 | NomadBudgeter">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Side-by-side city comparisons for digital nomads. Real 2026 data.">
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.nomadbudgeter.com/compare/">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <meta name="twitter:site" content="@nomadbudgeter">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --aura-bg: #080c14;
      --aura-surface: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --aura-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      --aura-text: #e8edf5;
      --aura-muted: #8a94a8;
      --aura-accent: #6c8fff;
      --aura-green: #3dffa0;
      --aura-amber: #ffb740;
      --font-display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --radius-md: 12px;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      background: var(--aura-bg);
      color: var(--aura-text);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 15% 10%, rgba(108,143,255,0.09) 0%, transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 85% 85%, rgba(61,255,160,0.07) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }
    .page-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 80px; }

    /* HERO */
    .hub-hero { padding: 64px 0 52px; text-align: center; }
    .hub-badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(108,143,255,0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(108,143,255,0.25);
      border-radius: 100px; padding: 6px 18px;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--aura-accent); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .hub-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hub-title span { color: var(--aura-accent); }
    .hub-desc { color: #9aa5bc; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 16px; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .hub-meta { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--aura-muted); }
    .hub-meta strong { color: var(--aura-green); }

    /* FILTER PILLS */
    .filter-row {
      display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 40px; justify-content: center;
    }
    .filter-pill {
      background: var(--aura-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--aura-border);
      border-radius: 100px; padding: 7px 16px;
      font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--aura-muted);
      cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .filter-pill:hover, .filter-pill.active {
      border-color: rgba(108,143,255,0.4);
      color: var(--aura-accent);
      background: rgba(108,143,255,0.08);
    }

    /* GRID */
    .showdown-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .showdown-card {
      background: var(--aura-surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--aura-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 28px 24px;
      text-decoration: none; color: var(--aura-text);
      transition: all 0.25s;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .showdown-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--aura-accent), var(--aura-green));
      opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.25s;
    }
    .showdown-card:hover { border-color: rgba(108,143,255,0.3); transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
    .showdown-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
    .card-flags { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 14px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 4px; }
    .card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .card-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      color: var(--aura-accent); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .card-tagline { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #8a94a8; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; flex: 1; }
    .card-meta {
      display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--aura-border); padding-top: 16px; margin-top: auto;
    }
    .card-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 100px; font-weight: 600;
    }
    .tag-cost { background: rgba(108,143,255,0.1); color: var(--aura-accent); }
    .tag-tax  { background: rgba(61,255,160,0.1);  color: var(--aura-green); }
    .tag-visa { background: rgba(255,183,64,0.1);  color: var(--aura-amber); }
    .card-arrow {
      position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 24px;
      color: var(--aura-muted); font-size: 1rem;
      transition: transform 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }
    .showdown-card:hover .card-arrow { transform: translate(3px,-3px); color: var(--aura-accent); }

    /* BOTTOM CTA */
    .hub-cta {
      margin-top: 64px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(108,143,255,0.1), rgba(61,255,160,0.07));
      border: 1px solid rgba(108,143,255,0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center;
    }
    .hub-cta h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hub-cta p { color: var(--aura-muted); max-width: 420px; margin: 0 auto 28px; }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: var(--aura-accent); color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 100px;
      text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #7fa0ff; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(108,143,255,0.3); }

    @media(max-width:640px) {
      .showdown-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hub-cta { padding: 32px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  {% include "partials/nav.njk" %}

  <main class="page-wrap">
    <div class="hub-hero">
      <div class="hub-badge">⚡ 2026 Real Data Only</div>
      <h1 class="hub-title">City <span>Showdowns</span></h1>
      <p class="hub-desc">Side-by-side comparisons of the world's top digital nomad destinations. Tax rates, cost of living, and visa requirements — all verified for 2026.</p>
      <p class="hub-meta">
        <strong>{{ showdowns | length }} comparisons</strong> · Last updated May 2026 · Sources cited on every page
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="filter-row">
      <div class="filter-pill active">All Cities</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">🇪🇺 Europe</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">🌏 Asia</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">🌎 LATAM</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">🇦🇪 Middle East</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">💰 Budget</div>
      <div class="filter-pill">📊 Tax Efficiency</div>
    </div>

    <div class="showdown-grid">
      {% for slug, d in showdowns %}
      <a href="/compare/city/{{ d.slug }}/" class="showdown-card">
        <span class="card-arrow">↗</span>
        <div class="card-flags">{{ d.emoji_a }}{{ d.emoji_b }}</div>
        <div class="card-title">{{ d.city_a }} vs {{ d.city_b }}</div>
        <div class="card-subtitle">{{ d.subtitle }}</div>
        <div class="card-tagline">{{ d.tagline }}</div>
        <div class="card-meta">
          <span class="card-tag tag-cost">💰 {{ d.cost_winner }} cheaper</span>
          <span class="card-tag tag-tax">📊 {{ d.tax_winner }} wins tax</span>
          <span class="card-tag tag-visa">🛂 {{ d.visa_winner }} wins visa</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="hub-cta">
      <h2>Run Your Real Numbers</h2>
      <p>Our 2026 tax engine calculates exact net income for 45+ countries. See where you actually keep the most.</p>
      <a href="/" class="btn-primary">⚡ Open Tax Calculator</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  {% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
